{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own fantasy match-ups of chaotic marbles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter your teams, pick your power-ups, and watch the laws of physics unravel in a marble-based simulation where no two matches ever play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it idle, stream it live, record fantasy football match-ups or beat the keeper videos for your channel, or use it to settle life\u2019s biggest decisions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhat takeaway are we getting tonight?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhat game shall I play next?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWho wins those 2 tickets to the Madonna 107th Birthday comeback tour!?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re here for the physics, the laughter, or the chaos, there\u2019s one rule: Fate will decide the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop your marbles into 40+ arenas and watch as power-ups randomly trigger every 30 seconds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slasher Attack</strong> \u2013 A deadly marble spawns, taking out any marble it touches. Score penalties, chaos, and panic ensue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chicken Mania</strong> \u2013 Chickens invade the pitch, attempting to score, hiding secrets... Will they be clucking good\u2026 or clucking bad?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiball</strong> \u2013 Suddenly a team has six marbles on the pitch instead of one. Total mayhem guaranteed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keeper Pause</strong> \u2013 The defending keeper freezes, leaving your marbles to wreak havoc on the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double Goals / Minus Goal Goals</strong> \u2013 Each goal counts for more\u2026 or less. High stakes, unpredictable outcomes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucky Escape</strong> \u2013 Even the Slasher can misfire. Fate is fickle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marbles respawn after losses, sometimes shiny, giving huge scoring swings. Every match is a rollercoaster of unpredictability, power-ups, and emergent comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play idle, watch chaos unfold, or hunt for hidden secrets and Easter eggs. Stream it, share it, and let fate \u2014 and physics \u2014 decide everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless chaos</strong> with 30-second power-ups \u2013 Slasher Attack, Multiball, Chicken Mania, Keeper Pause, Double Goals, Minus Goal Goals, and Lucky Escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chickens!</strong> \u2013 They can be harmless, they can be disastrous, they can be advantageous, some may hide rare marble unlocks...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fate cards</strong> - Will those chickens harm of help your favorite team?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+ marble designs</strong> \u2013 Unlock through quests, cryptic challenges, and secret chicken hunts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ pitch designs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle or interactive</strong> \u2013 Sit back and let the simulation run, or jump in and hunt rare targets for hidden rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-team mayhem</strong> \u2013 Full matches with 4 teams create insane unpredictability; 2-team matches are optional.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for streamers &amp; content creators</strong> \u2013 Wild matches, absurd score swings, and unique moments every session.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Team Slasher 01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093680/140839687ac02135d57a3b26021602312f22fb2b.jpg"},{"name":"Team Slasher 02","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093680/c6ef75ffd1380e3eac1cf2847780fcb501a61e63.jpg"},{"name":"Team Slasher 03","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093680/c7aed926217f8238439dca4f5badf37060f11e65.jpg"},{"name":"Team Slasher 04","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093680/3ea55f9961a3974c51fb7d17c9b0d6dab94349df.jpg"},{"name":"The Fairy Fox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093680/ee3f0d46db4964ed10918f7194ca2ac3a00407e0.jpg"},{"name":"Host a Spooky Cup","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093680/d6678f327314d7da3b598704df06cf7cb51777a3.jpg"},{"name":"Hatch the Dinoshi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093680/ad8bbd1144a05558061fab8f45f00a8c94f60769.jpg"},{"name":"The Inverted Fairy Fox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093680/e73037df0233db2899d254802f96dfbc0e398496.jpg"},{"name":"Stop the S.T.A.R.S Traitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093680/7994f6774e6d62c5726df192bb7db8ef7d5cd0eb.jpg"},{"name":"Prevent The One Ring from getting to Mordor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093680/198e1cbf83b8a38661bca923376e60305e787def.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093680?t=1767776512","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093680?t=1767776512","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093680/23ede3da6409070e59453a62c0d10ef1ccfbf5e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767776512","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093680/23ede3da6409070e59453a62c0d10ef1ccfbf5e8/capsule_184x69.jp